2026-10-15 UTC | Functional network reanalysis execution log
Scope: uploaded annotation snapshot + published functional cohort of 191 metagenomes.
Chat failures: the previously reported Invalid conversation body errors remain without a confirmed internal cause. No images are being uploaded.
Confirmed code issues and corrections:
1. 10D and 10E used while(sink.number(type="message") > 0), although an undiverted message sink reports connection 2. Corrected to reset once when the connection differs from 2. Both scripts now exit successfully after writing output.
