Runtime preparation: R 4.3.3 extracted locally from signed Ubuntu packages. Preliminary inference used igraph 1.6.0; final inference will use igraph 2.2.1 to match Landa. Initial source build failed at linkage because a local development symlink resolved to a static libgfortran; corrected local shared-library links and retried. No system R installation was changed.
